{"name":"Sacred Vortex","hex":"#a59c8d","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"sacred","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Characterized by solemn religious ceremony or religious use, especially, in a positive sense; consecrated, made holy.","Religious; relating to religion, or to the services of religion; not secular"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of sacre"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sacred"},{"term":"vortex","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A whirlwind, whirlpool, or similarly moving matter in the form of a spiral or column.","Anything that involves constant violent or chaotic activity around some centre."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To mix using a vortex mixer."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/vortex"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sacredness","blocks":[{"text":"Sacred describes something that is dedicated or set apart for the service or worship of a deity; is considered worthy of spiritual respect or devotion; or inspires awe or reverence among believers. The property is often ascribed to objects, or places."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sacredness"},{"title":"Vortex","blocks":[{"text":"In fluid dynamics, a vortex is a region in a fluid in which the flow revolves around an axis line, which may be straight or curved. Vortices form in stirred fluids and may be observed in smoke rings, whirlpools in the wake of a boat, and in the winds surrounding a tropical cyclone, tornado, or dust devil."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Airplane_vortex_edit.jpg/330px-Airplane_vortex_edit.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vortex"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/High_Priest_Offering_Sacrifice_of_a_Goat.jpg/500px-High_Priest_Offering_Sacrifice_of_a_Goat.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/High_Priest_Offering_Sacrifice_of_a_Goat.jpg/500px-High_Priest_Offering_Sacrifice_of_a_Goat.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The High Priest offers the sacrifice of a goat performing korban","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHigh_Priest_Offering_Sacrifice_of_a_Goat.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/17/Westernwall2.jpg/500px-Westernwall2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/17/Westernwall2.jpg/1280px-Westernwall2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/17/Westernwall2.jpg/500px-Westernwall2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Western Wall, one of the last relics of the Temple in Jerusalem","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWesternwall2.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Karman-Vortex.gif/500px-Karman-Vortex.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Karman-Vortex.gif/500px-Karman-Vortex.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Von Kármán vortex street behind a drinking straw; milk was poured into the water to make the current visible","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AKarman-Vortex.gif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Whirpool_Clouds.jpg/500px-Whirpool_Clouds.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Whirpool_Clouds.jpg/1280px-Whirpool_Clouds.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbn